{"4700250": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sisyphus's Worst Day (again)", "steam_appid": 4700250, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sisyphus’s Worst Day (Again) is an isometric 3D puzzle game where you manipulate the environment and place clever traps to keep Sisyphus from ever reaching the summit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn eternal punishment into your personal playground as you design devious systems, experiment with trap combinations, and trap the world’s most persistent worker in an infinite loop of failure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blending Greek myth with the absurdity of a 21st-century office grind, the game delivers a darkly comedic take on productivity, repetition, and the meaninglessness of… well, endlessly pushing that boulder.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sisyphus’s Worst Day (Again) is an isometric 3D puzzle game where you manipulate the environment and place clever traps to keep Sisyphus from ever reaching the summit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn eternal punishment into your personal playground as you design devious systems, experiment with trap combinations, and trap the world’s most persistent worker in an infinite loop of failure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blending Greek myth with the absurdity of a 21st-century office grind, the game delivers a darkly comedic take on productivity, repetition, and the meaninglessness of… well, endlessly pushing that boulder.</p>", "short_description": "Build traps, manipulate the environment, and engineer the perfect loop to keep Sisyphus from ever reaching the summit in this comedic isometric 3D puzzle game.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4700250/45af67e7cde02e627141041b066c9a24f29e0d33/header.jpg?t=1783437388", "capsule_image": "https:/